body:
I add some tests/context here.
Basically, call the endpoint http://localhost:3000/test should return the base url `http://localhost:3000`.

## Fiber + Adaptator + Otelfiber
```go
func main() {
	app := fiber.New()

	app.Use(otelfiber.Middleware())

	app.Get("/test", func(c *fiber.Ctx) error {
		return c.SendString(c.BaseURL())
	})
	
	http.ListenAndServe(":3000", adaptor.FiberApp(app))
}
```
Result: `http://`

